, 2026\nL122: \nL123: News What you need to know: Governor Gavin Newsom today signed SB 795, further accelerating the sale of E15 gasoline in California and helping give drivers access to another lower-cost fuel option as Donald Trump’s Iran war drives up prices at the pump nationwide and...\nL124: ## cite46†Governor Newsom expands film and TV tax credits with new legislation, creates tax credit to support post-production jobs L125: \nL126: Sep 19, 2026\nL127: \nL128: News What you need to know: Governor Newsom signed two bills to support thousands of film and television jobs in California by strengthening the state’s Film and TV Tax Credit Program and creating a new tax credit for post production work including editing, sound, and...\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBlog | Cognition (https://cognition.com/blog)\nciteturn934view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://cognition.com/blog\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 112\nL0: [Button: Menu]\nL1: \nL2: [Button: Close]\nL3: \nL4:   * cite0†Home L5:   * cite1†Careers L6:   * cite2†Research L7:   * cite3†Blog L8:   * cite4†Get a Demo L9:   * cite5†Devin†devin.ai L10: # Blog\nL11:   * cite6†Cognition and AWS team up to help ambitious teams ship more, faster 09.15.26 Cognition and AWS have entered a multi-year Strategic Collaboration Agreement to help enterprises deploy autonomous engineers in production, move legacy workloads to AWS faster, and clear engineering backlogs. L12:   * cite7†Introducing Fusion in Devin Desktop & CLI 09.11.26 Fusion is the most efficient frontier harness for Fable and Astra, up to 39% more efficient compared to other model harnesses across major coding benchmarks. Today, we’re making it available in Devin Desktop and CLI. L13:   * cite8†Welcoming Dioxus to Cognition 09.10.26 Jonathan Kelley and the Dioxus team are joining Cognition. We will continue supporting Dioxus, Blitz, Taffy, and Subsecond while increasing investment in Dioxus-Native and Blitz. L14:   * cite9†Introducing SWE-2: Pushing the Pareto Frontier 09.10.26 Today we’re introducing SWE-2, our most advanced coding model yet. SWE-2 delivers highly competitive agentic coding performance across multiple effort levels, pushing the Pareto frontier of capability and inference cost. L15:   * cite10†Factoring RSA-260 09.09.26 How Devin and a Cognition researcher built the world’s highest-performance GPU lattice siever, to make factoring numbers 10x cheaper than the previous state of the art L16:   * cite11†Do it all with Devin: Announcing our Series E 09.08.26 Cognition has raised over $2B at a $48B valuation, led by Andreessen Horowitz and Accel, to build the future of software engineering. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSalesforce Connector | SpaceXAI Docs (https://docs.x.ai/grok/connectors/salesforce)\nciteturn934view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://docs.x.ai/grok/connectors/salesforce\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 155\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPrimera notificación de una brecha de datos personales causada por un ataque ejecutado mediante un agente de IA | AEPD (https://www.aepd.es/prensa-y-comunicacion/blog/primera-notiviacion-brecha-datos-personales-causada-por-ataque-ejecutado-mediante-agente-ia)\nciteturn934view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn933view2\",\"id\":3}); Total lines: 12\n"
